    "body": "=== Breaking changes ===\r\nNo breaking changes\r\n\r\n=== All changes for this release ===\r\n97c5d0664 Fix platform macros.. (#9502)\r\n09fe4ff6f Preprocessor bug (#9495)\r\n528ddf730 add matrix tranpose support on metal (#9488)\r\n671b391fc Use the system-installed `slangc` compiler when building without dependencies (#9480)\r\n992ec72d8 Avoid infinite cycle when mangling struct defined inline at a parameter type location (#9482)\r\n7abf3a972 Activtely synthesize `AttributeDecl` for user defined attribute structs. (#9481)\r\n21296aff9 Add `-report-dynamic-dispatch-sites` flag (#9273)\r\nfe8bd58d1 move tests from bug directory to bugs (#9463)\r\n55d680e64 Preserve emtpy tuple elements in `createGLSLGlobalVaryings`. (#9479)\r\n794052b75 Fix mishandling of induction values in loop unrolling. (#9476)\r\n1027aa56e Reduce copying inside SourceFile::setContents; fix non-BOM UTF-16 offset and skip UTF-16 checks if file size is odd (#9407)\r\n2e66e603b Don't generate IR in `ComponentType::specialize` if spec arg is invalid. (#9453)\r\nf1165f5e9 Fix Copilot path mapping - mount _work to work not _work (#9473)\r\n23424c838 Add /runner to /home/runner bind mount for Copilot compatibility (#9470)\r\n7ea1506ad Emit a warning for a default-constructed interface variable and make it safer (#9421)\r\nc969c4bcd Remove container specification from copilot-setup-steps (#9468)\r\n3fe13e795 Remove container specification from copilot-setup-steps (#9466)\r\n70df5d2f3 Fix scope of local variables from inlined functions (#9418)\r\n831213310 Fix incorrect use of reinterpret_cast and union (#9458)\r\n71a5fc1d2 Fix Git safe.directory configuration for container workflows (#9461)\r\n8968b4a8b Add packages:read permission for container image authentication (#9464)\r\n2db7bd6d1 Use Custom Linux CI container image (#9460)\r\n25c1c6e5e emit-spirv: handle IRVoidType in emitDebugTypeImpl (#9414)\r\nd26153eed Install curl before Copilot preparation step (#9432)\r\na9d10b83c Revert \"Add workspace mounts to container options for Copilot compati… (#9426)\r\n262c3a6bc Add workspace mounts to container options for Copilot compatibility (#9424)\r\ndd4ba6e90 Skip slangpy-samples tests on macOS debug builds (#9408)\r\ndb9dd1616 Configure Copilot Coding Agent for ARC self-hosted GPU runner (#9415)"
