    "body": "=== Breaking changes ===\r\n12b9782ae Revert pr 9230, 9287 and 9321 (#9375)\r\n3fd9f501a CI test-slangpy: use a dedicated slangpy-samples branch (#9312)\r\n18d0a3a39 Add SER support for DXR 1.3 and VK EXT extensions (#7292, #9023) (#9230)\r\n\r\n=== All changes for this release ===\r\n5c5fe4d2a Fix fd leak (#9362)\r\n[BREAKING] 12b9782ae Revert pr 9230, 9287 and 9321 (#9375)\r\n5e8c5ae3c Document generic parameters in attributes (#9298)\r\n17818f20c Fix bindless resource heap placed in wrong descriptor set (#9281)\r\nda483a3e5 Update to latest external/slang-rhi (#9357)\r\nd040c9bdb Move existential specialization diagnostic to the specialization pass (#9359)\r\n5b8d64107 Fix UBSan errors: `memcpy()` and `memcmp()` called with null pointers (#9361)\r\ne50017036 Fix UBSan error: load of invalid `SpvOp` value (#9349)\r\n379113bce slangd: Canonicalize all paths found from search paths into URIs (#9279)\r\neaad58a2c Fix OpCapability Int64ImageEXT detection (#9308)\r\n2b8534c77 Enable Linux GPU CI with containerized builds and tests (#9173)\r\n19c632c23 Use label vulkancts for VK-GL-CTS nightly (#9353)\r\n4fd8f9109 Use curl instead of gh CLI for fork PR detection (#9118) (#9351)\r\n9f2c6d51e Install gh CLI and jq on Windows self-hosted runners (#9118) (#9347)\r\nd67d3819b Fix #9018 - HitObject.GetCurrentTime had incorrect availability (#9321)\r\n3e017fc14 Add CUDA support for HitObject.GetWorldToObject/GetObjectToWorld (#9287)\r\n0aae4853c Add SLANG_ASSERT environment variable support (#9313)\r\n9228bba58 Fix pragma warning rejection when using import statements (#9296)\r\ncfdbbbacc Add tool to split IR dumps into separate section files (#9247)\r\n5921ee673 Fix CI workflow branch fetch for fork PRs (#9327)\r\nfe7c6f369 Fix jq single-quote argument handling on Windows (#9320)\r\n[BREAKING] 3fd9f501a CI test-slangpy: use a dedicated slangpy-samples branch (#9312)\r\nd66c2c64b fix typo: unamed -> unnamed (#9299)\r\ndea92ad4c Fix the missing newline characters for the breaking changes (#9293)\r\nc3542ad69 Handle uninitialized resources in structs (#9151)\r\nd5eaf8230 Add name hint to DispatchMesh payload global variable for debuginfo (#9161)\r\n025c39466 Fix internal error when accessing ConstantBuffer<matrix> elements (#9280)\r\n[BREAKING] 18d0a3a39 Add SER support for DXR 1.3 and VK EXT extensions (#7292, #9023) (#9230)"
