    "body": "=== Breaking changes ===\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/72761cc366f10a5bdce6c09d0c3213522a515f99 Add error diagnostic for integer literals that don't fit into uint64_t (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9208)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/cc73e8dcf0e10eb6ead8cf3009850b4b8e6ab9a5 Remove the deprecated hlsl_coopvec_poc capability that was for POC CoopVec (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9213)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/4280f24832600b0f9b2ded0b45a7d7da2d04d73a Add type-flow analysis pass for specialized dynamic dispatch (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/7968)\r\n\r\n=== All changes for this release ===\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/65749cfe8e17ec65d77e8b30c30311f6190f5dd4 Diagnose if extension declares new interface requirements (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9276)\r\n[BREAKING] https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/72761cc366f10a5bdce6c09d0c3213522a515f99 Add error diagnostic for integer literals that don't fit into uint64_t (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9208)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/2db82e17075ce3c9f3d4a90a09432781ca26bae9 Fix CMake CMP0135 deprecation warning (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9243)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/cc532e4138401269c82cd5d214e692123731680d Fix a bug in const-fold for array size (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9259)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/dcb2b8e1e4f28cd3b97725e1900a24ffaa180412 Fix default implement method in generic interface (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9248)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/3f968f09329d72caa625dd132dbf0b1685a7b39b Enable passing tests with via-glsl option (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9264)\r\n[BREAKING] https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/cc73e8dcf0e10eb6ead8cf3009850b4b8e6ab9a5 Remove the deprecated hlsl_coopvec_poc capability that was for POC CoopVec (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9213)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/07868178186128a04fb80a6ed25f3729f67d860e Allow generic workgroup size. (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9245)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/26d2bf82eebdf09733ee5072bbd2b508a5436f64 Handle a file open attempt on a directory (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9217)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/89a1f99b4e1b9c3538d2ecc29f7bcad67c682e7d Save the base expression of ParenExpr in serialized AST (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9255)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/b77ace737649067f4d1a1a75302cd6f18a38502f Fix the issue that produce long mangled name (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9218)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/bd436a3599a447762b161686920c0191bfe1452a Revert \"Add diagnostic logging for slang-test debugging (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9066)\" (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9246)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/0358e80fd4cf8fab6e01a30a49779ccb2752fb9d Fix a bug in PolynomialIntVal's substitution logic. (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9244)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/9536d2f94df2f396a1a3f25314e3b1610a3f1e64 Fix rewriteValueUsesToAddrUses and add regression test (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9113)\r\n[BREAKING] https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/4280f24832600b0f9b2ded0b45a7d7da2d04d73a Add type-flow analysis pass for specialized dynamic dispatch (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/7968)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/e694c6c56aa665b77d2d7a034a3dd3a9854f31bc Enable Claude Code workflow on Windows self-hosted runners with GPU (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9204)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/d8c5a81637396a5ba854fcfb648ef8fd75fdd7d7 Add VS2026 Toolchain Support for CMake 4.2 (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9181)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/a96f01a8432aba5842f7ab6ed80453fe33ae2a4f Fix subtle bug when looking up symbols during pre-linking step (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9214)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/ea460c8dd9d20d1c44e8078cc4138e2fd84d714a Emit header files for cpp and cuda targets (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/3938)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/25b48c02cf1da665552ed77e5999a6130a32f380 Fix the bug when checking cuda version (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9207)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/412d3472a291f9fe9db49b9c2366d9943381538d Fix nested switch with continue incorrectly collecting parent loop blocks (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9166)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/e3e2262982998b7768fb349a8f7e815697966bc9 Handle nullptr in RenderTest (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9194)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/2e692bac6b795162b2ed1e7ec92bb71300ae539f Add workflow_dispatch trigger to Claude workflow (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9196)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/82f7892ef0814b042fc61e5389b6729d922d94c7 Add diagnostic logging for slang-test debugging (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9066)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/24c18cd49c80bdd86996439bcf68fbaa62c1bd61 Fix mojibake in error messages when .slang-module can't find source file (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9147)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/ddd642cc96b77f904710a5fb10b74acb7f4a867b Add error handling in createCompositeComponentType() for nullptr entries in componentTypes[] (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/8844)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/f7c497ad38d5e270c3d102c2bdc1a699017ed433 Correct HitTriangleVertexPosition documentation (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9193)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/abd333ab91a4c8a9d621ebfd7e4775adcbdadedd Fix lowering bug for generic static variables. (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9185)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/e61dcc8857658d82f1d729101cc93108b680a82e Preliminary support for spirv workgroup pointers. (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9186)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/2d65cc77340ff0ea540ff9cd0b9c98cc84781414 Issue a warning if requested bindless space index is not available (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9190)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/8251062819e5e9e844887d05e4a1cbb2d776cae1 Silence unused variable warnings in CUDA prelude (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9144)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/52305ee7bcb9c7cb1f21660fc85b7993f8c249f9 Allow override keyword inside extension (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9156)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/3f1798af213227d3c0cc8bb52dd35f3997c58e31 IR validating pass wrapper (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9159)\r\nhttps://github.com/shader-slang/slang/commit/6515cd98c5a6f5b45d2a7b814a737de03d533b57 Check compiler version for the _float16 support (https://github.com/shader-slang/slang/pull/9135)",
