    "body": "*PS: Please use v2025.23.1 if you need to use aarch64/windows build.\r\n\r\nNote that there are two breaking changes in this release.\r\n- with #9020, Slang will requires git-tag to present when building Slang from source\r\n- with #9005, Slang will return SLANG_UNKNOWN_SIZE as a special return value for reflection api functions when the array size is unknown.\r\n\r\n=== Breaking changes ===\r\nef568793a Add SLANG_VERSION for source archives (#9020)\r\nb5543cf9d Introduce SLANG_UNKNOWN_SIZE as a special return value for reflection api functions (#9005)\r\n\r\n=== All changes for this release ===\r\n[BREAKING] ef568793a Add SLANG_VERSION for source archives (#9020)\r\ndb30f83d5 Update claude-code-action to v1 with breaking parameter changes (#9119)\r\n970f0462b Fix intermittent build failure on examples (#9101)\r\n[BREAKING] b5543cf9d Introduce SLANG_UNKNOWN_SIZE as a special return value for reflection api functions (#9005)\r\na6667bc1e Disable imgui and stb dependencies in builds that disable test and gfx targets (#9049)\r\nfc6e76ddd  Correct inheritence documentation and add reminder to update docs (#9117)\r\n5c8f5b42f Add layout rule for ending CUDA entry point parameter structs without padding (#9090)\r\n464c036a5 Mark HLSL only RWStructuredBuffer::IncrementCounter and DecrementCounter (#9091)\r\nc25ca8ec5 Fix generated SPIR-V for GetClusterID() (#9107)\r\n6316dad75 Disable Clang optimizations for `Session::get*LibraryCode()` functions (#9069)\r\ncc00aea13 build: Inform user when downloading (#9094)\r\n7cf2a23ab Fix/change string template meta keyword (#9076)\r\n74b3937a3 Soften the deprecation notice tone for slang-torch documentation (#9075)\r\n33bc5eeeb Revert \"Fix intermittent build failure on examples (#9059)\" (#9095)\r\n9674aeef9 UserGuide: Add missing ref to GLSL Target (#9083)\r\n064ca3d2f Declare OpCapability ClipDistance when needed (#9089)\r\ne6bdd92b1 GLSL shadow cube array fixes (#9084)\r\na82e1cab3 Improved half/float16 support for C++ & CUDA targets (#8986)\r\n23d7b4c1e Use posix_spawn in slang-unix-process.cpp (#9081)\r\n6f446e47b Fix #9051: Add atomicAdd wrapper for signed int64_t on CUDA (#9064)\r\nb3758d853 Fix int64 typedef cuda by making it  (#9065)\r\n6a6435281 Support ByteAddressBuffer legalization with dynamic branching (#8815)\r\n938e51ee9 Fix documentation of __targetHasImplicitDerivatives() (#9014)\r\n338348133 Update SPIRV module (#9063)\r\n768ae5129 Fix intermittent build failure on examples (#9059)\r\nd90d86951 Fix generic function overloads in reflection API (#9052)\r\n1152af7b2 Fix Sample() with depth texture + sampler comparison state; add minimal repro (#9043)\r\n7d0518956 Add HitObject Optix implementation for HitObject.GetObjectRayOrigin and GetHitKind (#8990)\r\nec34d697f Add type unification logic to handle `LambdaDecl`/Functor's with `FuncType` (#9010)\r\n118425252 Update slang-rhi and mlp-training-coopvec example (#9036)\r\nce376e1ef Add placeholder workflow for RTX Remix shader compilation testing (#9042)\r\n5ec726715 Add CI testing for slangpy-samples (#8938)\r\nfd3b7290e Implement SampleCmpBias and SampleCmpGrad (#8931)\r\ne63125213 Fix missing debug line numbers for repacked struct members in SPIR-V (#9028)\r\n75aefce6a Improve typename deduction in slang-emit-spirv (#9026)\r\nd9b92cc66 Validate -render-features in render-test (#8940)\r\n0f4d0f693 Add OptiX multi-level traversal intrinsics (#8660)\r\n1c4a26b8f Fix FileStream EOF detection (#9017)\r\na025170b1 Implement emitOpDebugTypeFunction for SPIR-V (#8993)\r\nd1fbce396 Fix null pointer dereference in emitCalleeDebugInlinedAt (#8978)\r\n3ecc3b6e1 Fix slang's slangpy CI testing across versions (#8969)"
