    "body": "=== Breaking changes ===\r\ndcb47b716 Rename library from slang to slang-compiler and version library names (#8746)\r\n\r\n=== All changes for this release ===\r\n3a2969a32 Lower CopyLogical before SPIRV control flow legalization. (#8883)\r\n[BREAKING] dcb47b716 Rename library from slang to slang-compiler and version library names (#8746)\r\nec346e4f8 Add python script to extract slang source files from spirv dump. (#8860)\r\n92643cf54 Enable LLVM cache for builds in self-hosted machines (#8877)\r\n361bd2801 Remove Claude local memory file, and ignore it (#8871)\r\nca319c5c5 Add Git pre-commit hook to format the code (#8872)\r\n8100b9915 Update SPIRV-Tools and SPIRV-Headers to latest versions (#8869)\r\n06c442fbd Fix NVRTC silent failures when CUDA/OptiX headers are missing (#8623)\r\n443a9b77c Optix coopvec matmul (#8489)\r\n0ff7e1dbd Use full module name when serializing ImportDecl. (#8867)\r\n3abc3dd58 Disable LLVM cache to fix build issue in self-hosted machines (#8861)\r\n87645a42b Handle Sampler array in combined texture sampler lowering pass. (#8856)\r\n51046ecaf Save cache only if the job is running from master branch (#8864)\r\n7d7640232 Fix static_assert(false) in CUDA prelude (#8863)\r\n4675036f2 Var type auto deduction should open ref the init expr. (#8853)\r\n6b1105b01 Fix OptiX 8.1 compatibility for optixMakeHitObject wrappers. Fix #8723 (#8730)\r\n2371d576b Add descriptor handle support to render test framework (#8814)\r\nf1aba9fdf Preserve differentiable context when checking let/var initializer expressions (#8850)\r\nd498114cb Fix the order comparison in checkGenericTypeEqualityConstraintSubType (#8851)\r\n8ab3f3ce5 Fix Atomic::load() being incorrectly marked as mutating (#8807)\r\nf8b55418b Diagnose an error on specialization using existential types. (#8839)\r\nb42c34582 Add neural.slang module (#8602)"
