    "body": "=== Breaking changes ===\r\n0ab33f742 Add `const` qualifier to `TargetDesc::compilerOptionEntries` (#8824)\r\n\r\n=== All changes for this release ===\r\n708e1bbe1 Use `CopyLogical` to further defer storage-to-logical translation when emitting SPIRV. (#8819)\r\n8f7c1b07e Add support for SPIR-V extension instruction sets in direct emission (#8778)\r\n[BREAKING] 0ab33f742 Add `const` qualifier to `TargetDesc::compilerOptionEntries` (#8824)\r\n1f888a367 Update LLVM from 14.0.6 to 21.1.2 (#8737)\r\na0f023e06 Fix a cap issue in __target_switch (#8766)\r\n673af6bb8 Switch Linux aarch64 release builder to 22.04 (#8805)\r\nf56bf5ab4 Inherit secrets to nightly coverage workflow (#8812)\r\nd8f73df8a Use actions/checkout in coverage report deployment (#8810)\r\nb0c211564 Use a personal access token (#8808)\r\n1969d667f Fix `static_assert` incorrectly triggering in dead-branches when `-minimum-slang-optimization` is enabled (#8784)\r\n19fbbcf85 Publish coverage runs in a separate repo (#8789)\r\n4d046d769 Fix undefined behaviour in obfuscate-specialization-naming test (#8764)\r\n74fd8dc83 Don't run test if applyBinding fails (#8765)\r\n2495e0880 Enable Vulkan-SPIRV validation rules, and fix all validation errors. (#8752)\r\nfbe741a8a Update CONTRIBUTING.md to include Metal Toolchain installation (#8773)\r\n73521aa49 LLVM coverage support (#8651)\r\n54db8afde Generate more IR inst functions from lua (#8688)\r\n6ddf54a52 Fixed wrong enum in user guide code example for bindless descriptor access (#8756)\r\nfabab8d24 WGSL: Update depth texture constraints and add missing test coverage (#8699)\r\nf329c13f6 Additional fix to calls with no_diff variadic type pack. (#8750)\r\nff064b9a0 Fix infinite loop in SPIRVLegalizationContext::processWorkList (#8712)\r\n74d93c0fe Re-enable slangpy test_blit.py::test_generate_mips for CUDA. (#8740)\r\na890ddece Update SPIRV-Tools and SPIRV-Headers to latest versions (#8722)\r\nbedc3421c Fix use of variadic generics with [Differentiable]. (#8736)\r\nd8b732d7b Update slang-rhi (#8709)\r\n7e35123ba Fix WGSL bitshift test typo (#8720)\r\n01510f2c9 Immutable access qualifier for pointers and use `__ldg` on cuda. (#8710)\r\nd1a935c68 [CI] Skip slangpy test_blit.py::test_generate_mips for CUDA (#8725)\r\n907410f6a Clean up Slang IR representation of undefined values (#8708)\r\n05cae938c Retry file reads in slang-test to handle intermittent I/O errors (#8713)"
