    "body": "=== Breaking changes ===\r\nNo breaking changes\r\n\r\n=== All changes for this release ===\r\n9c2024a75 Remove unnecessary Load and Store pair (#8433)\r\n979e16a34 Adding slang-test option to ignore abort popup message (#8492)\r\n796ea80a0 Enhance SPIRV-Headers update instructions\r\nd61d6b57d Legalize type as well in legalizeOperand (#8483)\r\n21c663605 Lookup refactor (#8467)\r\n7740f7905 fix a crash when using type equality constaint (#8515)\r\n9e34c6d94 Fix varying output structs in GLSL source (#8501)\r\nc35b763f8 Split overloaded uses of RefType in front-end (#8427)\r\nba8132345 Add RHI Device Caching and Test Prefix Exclusion (#8448)\r\nbd24cc271 Reduce the maxprocesses to 3 for slangpy test (#8502)\r\nc991ad46e Fixed typo in `SemanticsVisitor::_readAggregateValueFromInitializerList` (#8504)\r\n4d8ff3488 Revise SPIRV-Headers update instructions in documentation (#8488)\r\nc8d189bd5 Use LOAD_LIBRARY_SEARCH_DEFAULT_DIRS for LoadLibraryExW (#8491)\r\nc6d8c6b68 Check if any required jobs failed (allow success or skipped) (#8495)\r\n48cbbcfeb Fix SPIRV headers precedence (#8481)\r\n391d35d63 include limits.h in slang-platform.cpp (#8473)\r\ned9f42361 Fix DebugCompilationUnit to reference main shader file instead of header files (#7957)\r\n54faa55c0 Fix CUDA global variable initialization with constructor calls (#8340)",
