    "body": "=== Breaking changes ===\r\nafb8146e1 Diagnose error when the function args can't satisfy constexpr parameter requirements (#7269)\r\n\r\n=== All changes for this release ===\r\n206f6cf56 Add WASM FS module support for slang-playground (#8459)\r\n58060d2f7 Set default mimalloc for spirv-tools but allow user to override (#8460)\r\n8d67365b3 Diagnostic for metal ref mesh output assignment (#8365)\r\n570277137 Use self-hosted runner for Windows release build (#8470)\r\n5610d7845 Fix LSS intrinsics for hit objects in ray tracing tests (#8469)\r\nb5078d121 Added __magic_enum (#8436)\r\n64d23f2a5 Change CI to use locally installed sdk (#8450)\r\n[BREAKING] afb8146e1 Diagnose error when the function args can't satisfy constexpr parameter requirements (#7269)\r\n8ad0ae178 Enable static mimalloc in Spriv-Tools (#8419)\r\n8bcf6c443 Fix segfault in SPIR-V header processing in SpirvInstructionHelper (#8428)\r\nf3e26754c Add FindModifier for Declarations (#8308)\r\nc5607e9d6 Fix crash when compiling specialized generic entrypoint containing a static const decl. (#8392)\r\nec42c4a20 Fix pointers and C-like layout in varying parameters (#8425)\r\nb03cbb02c Squash warnings on gcc 14 (#8377)\r\n3d0f5ee55 CUDA: Fix compiler crash with unsized array field - nonuniformres-as-… (#8380)\r\n2020a102e Check if debugVar for is debuggable types in the legalization pass (#8326)\r\n43dffcde7 Fix language server auto-complete regression in debug build. (#8416)\r\n7026dec79 Update SPIRV-{Tools,Headers} (#8415)\r\ne554e1b72 Send notification only on scheduled CTS runs (#8418)\r\n8aa63073c Enable ccache in slang bulid for CTS test (#8413)\r\n3745d7554 Always define OptixTraversableHandle (#8411)\r\n35b780825 Enable slang_lldb.py on macos (#8327)\r\n63676c5e5 Fix #8314 - Enable tests/compute/texture-subscript.slang for CUDA (#8408)",
