    "body": "=== Breaking changes ===\r\nNo breaking changes\r\n\r\n=== All changes for this release ===\r\n352576546 A new approach to AST node deduplication (#8072)\r\n5074c4948 Fix noperspective modifier for SV_Barycentrics in SPIRV and GLSL (#8067)\r\nd10732742 Fix 7723 - Add autodiff tests (#7919)\r\n68b012522 Add reflection api for overload candidate filtering. (#8066)\r\n83675103a Implement SPV_EXT_fragment_invocation_density (SPV_NV_shading_rate) (#8037)\r\n2d775b54d Bring back hooks for auto formatting and ensure build works (#7811)\r\n9a16700e8 Enable compute/ dir which passes (#7991)\r\nde6a87a86 Add missing `ASTBuilder` methods for int types (#8056)\r\nce53e9c67 Clarify downstream and direct compilation paths in design overview doc (#8021)\r\n301ffb194 Fix #pragma warning not working with multifile modules (#7942)\r\n41314741d Omit \"Repro\" category from default help text output (#8032)\r\n3f12964b2 Add support for pointer literals in metal (#8040)\r\n34840bb69 fix overload in extension issue (#7999)\r\n8a15efb37 Drain sink when single-argument constructor call fail (#7883)\r\n6239a67cb Reenable debug-layers on CI (#8017)\r\nef743e716 Enable debug-layers for examples when not using test-mode (#8024)\r\na660640d4 Restrict the release tag name to a pattern the build script expects (#8027)\r\n374026df1 disable ray-tracing-pipeline test (#8023)\r\nbdda8a90c Fix 7441: CUDA boolean vector layout to use 1-byte elements (#7862)\r\n7a133445e Omit \"Invalid\" capability from slangc -h output (#8020)\r\n5e2463067 Omit listing values in slangc -h cmdline output, show how to list them seperately (#8012)\r\n96346cd67 Omit \"Internal\" category from default help text output (#8013)\r\ne313300d2 Fix segmentation fault in ray tracing parameter consolidation. (#7997)\r\n30fd3c63f Add matrix select intrinsic (#7566)\r\naefd1e3e0 Handle debug-layer messages in a separate channel (#7988)\r\n4a255d211 Fix bug in ci test (#8005)\r\n8e1a6a1b4 Update to latest slang-rhi (#8006)\r\n29f5d1f10 Exclude a list of expensive slang-rhi tests to speed up CI (#8004)\r\n66301ab90 msvc style bitfield packing (#7963)\r\ndb59c22cf Reduce merge_group CI workload. (#7996)\r\nc4dd2eb00 disallow `static const` variables without default-value (#7993)\r\n5f9547b9c [Language Server]: Don't eagerly check file upon open doc. (#7995)\r\n92ee2927d Lowering unsupported matrix types for GLSL/WGSL/Metal targets (#7936)\r\n42dc521f7 Disable more CI workflows on master push. (#7983)\r\n4fdc967eb Disable debug-layers temporarlily on CI (#7972)",
